<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets 2-wk repo with limit rate 15.2%.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets 2-wk repo with limit rate 15.2%.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Thursday set a two week reverse repo to drain liquidity with a limit rate of 15.2 percent down from 15.4 percent on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
